+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+set +e
+
+if [[ $# -lt 2 ]]; then
+  echo "usage: run_logged.sh LOG COMMAND [ARG ...]" >&2
+  exit 2
+fi
+
+log=$1
+shift
+
+{
+  printf 'COMMAND:'
+  printf ' %q' "$@"
+  printf '\n'
+  "$@"
+  status=$?
+  printf '\nEXIT_STATUS: %d\n' "$status"
+  exit "$status"
+} >"$log" 2>&1

All seven mandated stages completed. The fresh source reconstruction closed the only positive claim, exhaustive static inventory found no target-relevant unsoundness or proof-local extensions, and both reviewer-authored negative probes failed as expected. REVIEW.md ends with PASS / LEGIT.
